<hr>
<section id="introduction" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="introduction">Introduction</h2>
<p>Does a fighter’s weight class lead to more knockouts in the UFC?</p>
<p>This project goes over fights from 2016-2026, comparing the difference in fight outcomes, time and knockout rates between different weight classes. The goal is to find out if a heavier weight class is associated with more knockouts in the octagon within the last decade.</p>
